  "lore": "Burdam keeps the ledger for a dome-village on the east rim, and the scored mask he wears is that ledger: one cut for every debt owed to his people. He is a generous host and a terrible creditor. Strike him once and he will remember the day, the hour and the angle of the light. Serenade children are told that he has never forgotten a slight, which is not quite true; he has forgiven three. He carries an ironstone cleaver as tall as he is, mostly so that nobody asks about the other ledger.",
